ok alClient child: client width
ok PixelsPerInch: the window DPI
ok window client width = ClientWidth
ok window client height = ClientHeight
ok window width = Width
ok window height = Height
ok ClientWidth with a handle resizes the window
ok layout follows
# real client size adopted
ok external resize: real client width
ok external resize: real client height
ok layout pass: child width
ok layout pass: child height
ok outer width follows the window
ok tiny form: ClientWidth is the real client width
